Subject: [PATCH 02/13] intel_rapl: remove hardcoded register index
Date:   Tue, 25 Jun 2019 23:16:37 +0800
Message-Id: <1561475808-24839-3-git-send-email-rui.zhang@intel.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.7.4
